---
Implement distortion/saturation effect.

Multiple distortion modes for adding harmonics and grit.
Essential for 808 bass processing and lo-fi aesthetics.

## Parameters
- drive: Input gain / distortion amount (0-10, default 1.0)
- mode: Distortion algorithm (soft clip, hard clip, foldback, bitcrush)
- tone: Post-distortion LP filter frequency (200-20000 Hz)
- wet: Wet/dry mix (0-1, default 0.5)

## Algorithms
- Soft clip: tanh(x * drive)
- Hard clip: clamp(x * drive, -1, 1)
- Foldback: triangle wave folding at ±1
- Bitcrush: reduce bit depth (1-16 bits) + sample rate reduction

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] EFFECT_DISTORTION added to effect type enum
- [ ] 4 distortion modes implemented
- [ ] No DC offset introduced (subtract mean if needed)
- [ ] Tone control smooths harsh harmonics
- [ ] Works in effect chain (per-track and master)

## Test Plan
- [ ] Verify each mode produces audible distortion
- [ ] Verify bitcrush reduces quality predictably
- [ ] Export with distortion, inspect waveform
